VERSION 2
RULE flutter.dio.certificate-callback-accepts-all VERSION 1
IN FILE
WHEN TEXT_MATCHES "\\b(?:badCertificateCallback\\s*[:=]|onBadCertificate\\s*:)\\s*\\([^)]*\\)\\s*(?:=>\\s*true\\b|\\{\\s*return\\s+true\\b)" ""
REPORT "TLS Certificate Validation Review"
SEVERITY MEDIUM
CONFIDENCE LOW
WITH TRACE
